    falseBeliefs: []
    allowedLieOrEvasionNotes: Generally cooperative. She may hesitate when discussion
      reaches Adrian's financial problems because she is hiding the fact that she
      has been helping him financially.
    temporaryHardCodedResponse: I'll help if I can, Detective. This has been a terrible
      evening, and I'm trying to remember everything clearly.
  - npcDefinition: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 7bae6e6272a99194d8b3b79250c741b8, type: 2}
    startingRoom: 1
    spawnPointId: dining_npc_main
    knownFacts:
